		Description: "<span style=\"color:DarkTurquoise\">Jackson</span> has invited you to attend <span style=\"color:Teal\">Lenny’s Wild West</span> show with him at the <span style=\"color:Teal\">Community Center</span>. It’s <span style=\"color:Teal\">Friday</span> after school around <span style=\"color:Teal\">4PM</span>. You wonder what sort of show it will be.",
